@startuml
title Notification Sequence Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Actor User" as ActorUser
participant "Source Service" as SourceService
participant "NotificationService" as NotificationService
participant "NotificationRepository" as NotificationRepository
database "MySQL" as MySQL
actor "Recipient User" as RecipientUser
participant "Angular Notifications UI" as RecipientApp
participant "Security Filter" as Security
participant "NotificationController" as NotificationController

== Notification Creation ==

ActorUser -> SourceService: Follow, comment, react, or send message
SourceService -> NotificationService: createNotification(...)
NotificationService -> NotificationService: Build title, body, targetType, targetId
NotificationService -> NotificationRepository: save(notification unread)
NotificationRepository -> MySQL: Insert notifications row
MySQL --> NotificationRepository: Notification saved
NotificationService --> SourceService: Notification persisted

== Load Notification Count ==

RecipientUser -> RecipientApp: Use app shell
RecipientApp -> Security: GET /notifications/unread-count
Security -> Security: Validate Bearer JWT

alt Token invalid or expired
  Security --> RecipientApp: 401 Unauthorized
  RecipientApp --> RecipientUser: Redirect to login
else Token valid
  Security -> NotificationController: Authenticated count request
  NotificationController -> NotificationService: getUnreadCount(currentUser)
  NotificationService -> NotificationRepository: count unread by recipient
  NotificationRepository -> MySQL: Query notifications
  MySQL --> NotificationRepository: Count
  NotificationService --> NotificationController: Count response
  NotificationController --> RecipientApp: 200 OK
  RecipientApp --> RecipientUser: Show unread badge
end

== Open Notifications ==

RecipientUser -> RecipientApp: Open notifications page
RecipientApp -> Security: GET /notifications
Security -> NotificationController: Authenticated list request
NotificationController -> NotificationService: getNotifications(currentUser)
NotificationService -> NotificationRepository: Load notifications
NotificationRepository -> MySQL: Query notifications
MySQL --> NotificationRepository: Notification list
NotificationService --> NotificationController: Notification page
NotificationController --> RecipientApp: 200 OK
RecipientApp --> RecipientUser: Display notifications

== Mark Read And Navigate ==

RecipientUser -> RecipientApp: Click notification
RecipientApp -> Security: PATCH /notifications/{id}/read
Security -> NotificationController: Authenticated read request
NotificationController -> NotificationService: markAsRead(id, currentUser)
NotificationService -> NotificationRepository: Load and update notification
NotificationRepository -> MySQL: Update is_read and read_at
MySQL --> NotificationRepository: Updated notification
NotificationService --> NotificationController: Updated notification
NotificationController --> RecipientApp: 200 OK
RecipientApp -> RecipientApp: Navigate by targetType/targetId
RecipientApp --> RecipientUser: Open target post, message, or profile

@enduml
